## Title: Adventure Plates
## Notes: An adventurer plate for your character, like Final Fantasy XIV's: your model, title, guild, level and class, the roles you play, your playstyle, when you are usually on, and a motto. /plate opens yours, /plate <name> shows another player's (they need the addon too).
